Verse 1:
[C7]And [F]have [Bb]the [F]bright [Gm]im[F]men[Dm]si[C]ties
[Dm]Re[Gm]ceived [F]our [Gm7]ri[C7]sen [F]Lord,
[C7]Where [F]light [Bb]years [F]frame [Gm]the [F]Ple[Dm]ia[C]des
[Dm]And [Gm]point [F]O[Gm7]ri[C7]on’s [F]sword?
